OL,3,GNEWSAFootbridge officially reopens
OL,4,Aafter safety work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA temporary footbridge in Derby has
OL,7,Fbeen officially reopened with a
OL,8,Fribbon-cutting ceremony.
OL,10,FWalter's Walkway was installed on top
OL,11,Fof Darley Abbey Mills Bridge after it
OL,12,Fclosed in May 2022 due to safety
OL,13,Fconcerns.
OL,15,FHowever the prefabricated bridge was
OL,16,Fitself closed in December 2025 due to
OL,17,Ffresh concerns about the 1930s
OL,18,Fstructure underneath, before being
OL,19,Flifted out in July to allow the
OL,20,Foriginal bridge to be demolished.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
